{
  "version": "Notebook/1.0",
  "items": [
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "# 🔒 WUfB Reports - Quality Updates Compliance\n\nReport sullo stato di installazione dei **Quality Update (Security e Non-Security)** per ciascun device.\nDati integrati da: `UCClientUpdateStatus`, `UCClient`, `UCServiceUpdateStatus`, `UCUpdateAlert`, `UCDeviceAlert`.\n\n---"
      },
      "name": "text-header"
    },
    {
      "type": 9,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "id": "b1a1e001-1111-4a1a-b1c1-111111111111",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "TimeRange",
            "type": 4,
            "isRequired": true,
            "typeSettings": {
              "selectableValues": [
                {
                  "durationMs": 86400000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 259200000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 604800000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 1209600000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 2592000000
                }
              ],
              "allowCustom": true
            },
            "value": {
              "durationMs": 604800000
            },
            "label": "Intervallo Temporale"
          },
          {
            "id": "b1a1e001-2222-4a1a-b1c1-222222222222",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "UpdateClassificationFilter",
            "type": 2,
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": true,
            "quote": "'",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "query": "UCClientUpdateStatus\n| where TimeGenerated > ago(30d)\n| where UpdateCategory == 'WindowsQualityUpdate'\n| distinct UpdateClassification\n| order by UpdateClassification asc",
            "typeSettings": {
              "additionalResourceOptions": [
                "value::all"
              ],
              "selectAllValue": "*"
            },
            "defaultValue": "value::all",
            "queryType": 0,
            "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
            "label": "Classificazione (Security/NonSecurity)"
          },
          {
            "id": "b1a1e001-3333-4a1a-b1c1-333333333333",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "DeviceNameFilter",
            "type": 1,
            "isRequired": false,
            "value": "",
            "label": "Filtro Device Name (contiene)"
          }
        ],
        "style": "pills",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces"
      },
      "name": "parameters"
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "## 📊 Panoramica Compliance Quality Update (da UCClient)"
      },
      "name": "text-section-overview"
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "let _deviceFilter = \"{DeviceNameFilter}\";\nUCClient\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| where _deviceFilter == \"\" or DeviceName contains _deviceFilter\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by AzureADDeviceId\n| summarize\n    TotalDevices = count(),\n    QualityLatest = countif(OSQualityUpdateStatus == \"Latest\"),\n    QualityNotLatest = countif(OSQualityUpdateStatus == \"NotLatest\"),\n    SecurityLatest = countif(OSSecurityUpdateStatus == \"Latest\"),\n    SecurityNotLatest = countif(OSSecurityUpdateStatus == \"NotLatest\"),\n    SecurityMultipleMissing = countif(OSSecurityUpdateStatus == \"MultipleSecurityUpdatesMissing\")",
        "size": 4,
        "title": "Stato Compliance Globale",
        "timeContext": {
          "durationMs": 0
        },
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
        "visualization": "tiles",
        "tileSettings": {
          "titleContent": {
            "columnMatch": "Column1",
            "formatter": 1
          },
          "leftContent": {
            "columnMatch": "TotalDevices",
            "formatter": 12,
            "formatOptions": {
              "palette": "auto"
            }
          },
          "showBorder": true
        }
      },
      "name": "tiles-compliance-overview"
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "let _deviceFilter = \"{DeviceNameFilter}\";\nUCClient\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| where _deviceFilter == \"\" or DeviceName contains _deviceFilter\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by AzureADDeviceId\n| summarize Devices = count() by OSSecurityUpdateStatus\n| order by Devices desc",
        "size": 3,
        "title": "Security Update Status",
        "timeContext": {
          "durationMs": 0
        },
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
        "visualization": "piechart",
        "chartSettings": {
          "seriesLabelSettings": [
            {
              "seriesName": "Latest",
              "color": "green"
            },
            {
              "seriesName": "NotLatest",
              "color": "orange"
            },
            {
              "seriesName": "MultipleSecurityUpdatesMissing",
              "color": "redBright"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "customWidth": "50",
      "name": "chart-security-status"
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "let _deviceFilter = \"{DeviceNameFilter}\";\nUCClient\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| where _deviceFilter == \"\" or DeviceName contains _deviceFilter\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by AzureADDeviceId\n| summarize Devices = count() by OSQualityUpdateStatus\n| order by Devices desc",
        "size": 3,
        "title": "Quality Update Status",
        "timeContext": {
          "durationMs": 0
        },
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
        "visualization": "piechart",
        "chartSettings": {
          "seriesLabelSettings": [
            {
              "seriesName": "Latest",
              "color": "green"
            },
            {
              "seriesName": "NotLatest",
              "color": "orange"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "customWidth": "50",
      "name": "chart-quality-status"
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "## 📋 Stato Installazione Quality Update per Device e KB (UCClientUpdateStatus)"
      },
      "name": "text-section-detail"
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "let _classification = dynamic([{UpdateClassificationFilter}]);\nlet _deviceFilter = \"{DeviceNameFilter}\";\nUCClientUpdateStatus\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| where UpdateCategory == \"WindowsQualityUpdate\"\n| extend DeviceName = iff(isempty(DeviceName), AzureADDeviceId, DeviceName)\n| where \"*\" in (_classification) or UpdateClassification in (_classification)\n| where _deviceFilter == \"\" or DeviceName contains _deviceFilter\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by AzureADDeviceId, TargetKBNumber\n| join kind=leftouter (\n    UCClient\n    | where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n    | summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by AzureADDeviceId\n    | project AzureADDeviceId, OSVersion, OSBuild, OSEdition, WUQualityDeferralDays, WUQualityPauseState, LastWUScanTime\n) on AzureADDeviceId\n| project\n    DeviceName,\n    TargetKBNumber,\n    UpdateDisplayName,\n    UpdateClassification,\n    ClientState,\n    ClientSubstate,\n    ClientSubstateTime,\n    TargetBuild,\n    UpdateReleaseTime,\n    OfferReceivedTime,\n    RestartRequiredTime,\n    UpdateInstalledTime,\n    OSVersion,\n    OSBuild,\n    OSEdition,\n    WUQualityDeferralDays,\n    WUQualityPauseState,\n    LastWUScanTime,\n    TimeGenerated\n| order by DeviceName asc, TargetKBNumber asc",
        "size": 0,
        "title": "Dettaglio Quality Update per Device (con info device da UCClient)",
        "timeContext": {
          "durationMs": 0
        },
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
        "visualization": "table",
        "gridSettings": {
          "formatters": [
            {
              "columnMatch": "ClientState",
              "formatter": 18,
              "formatOptions": {
                "thresholdsOptions": "icons",
                "thresholdsGrid": [
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Installed",
                    "representation": "success",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Installing",
                    "representation": "2",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Offering",
                    "representation": "warning",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "OnHold",
                    "representation": "4",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Canceled",
                    "representation": "cancelled",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Unknown",
                    "representation": "unknown",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "Default",
                    "representation": "unknown",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "columnMatch": "UpdateClassification",
              "formatter": 18,
              "formatOptions": {
                "thresholdsOptions": "icons",
                "thresholdsGrid": [
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Security",
                    "representation": "3",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "NonSecurity",
                    "representation": "1",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "Default",
                    "representation": "unknown",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "filter": true,
          "sortBy": [
            {
              "itemKey": "DeviceName",
              "sortOrder": 1
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "grid-quality-update-detail"
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "## 📈 Riepilogo Compliance per KB\n\nLa percentuale usa come denominatore soltanto i device che hanno prodotto uno stato per la KB."
      },
      "name": "text-section-kb-summary"
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "let _classification = dynamic([{UpdateClassificationFilter}]);\nlet _deviceFilter = \"{DeviceNameFilter}\";\nUCClientUpdateStatus\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| where UpdateCategory == \"WindowsQualityUpdate\"\n| extend DeviceName = iff(isempty(DeviceName), AzureADDeviceId, DeviceName)\n| where \"*\" in (_classification) or UpdateClassification in (_classification)\n| where _deviceFilter == \"\" or DeviceName contains _deviceFilter\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by AzureADDeviceId, TargetKBNumber\n| summarize\n    ReportingDevices = dcount(AzureADDeviceId),\n    Installed = dcountif(AzureADDeviceId, ClientState == \"Installed\"),\n    Installing = dcountif(AzureADDeviceId, ClientState == \"Installing\"),\n    Offering = dcountif(AzureADDeviceId, ClientState == \"Offering\"),\n    OnHold = dcountif(AzureADDeviceId, ClientState == \"OnHold\"),\n    Unknown = dcountif(AzureADDeviceId, ClientState == \"Unknown\")\n    by TargetKBNumber, UpdateDisplayName, UpdateClassification, UpdateReleaseTime\n| extend PercentInstalledReported = round(todouble(Installed) / todouble(ReportingDevices) * 100, 1)\n| order by UpdateReleaseTime desc",
        "size": 0,
        "title": "Compliance per KB tra device con stato riportato",
        "timeContext": {
          "durationMs": 0
        },
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
        "visualization": "table",
        "gridSettings": {
          "formatters": [
            {
              "columnMatch": "PercentInstalledReported",
              "formatter": 8,
              "formatOptions": {
                "min": 0,
                "max": 100,
                "palette": "redGreen"
              }
            }
          ],
          "filter": true
        }
      },
      "name": "grid-kb-compliance"
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "## 🚦 Service-Side Status (UCServiceUpdateStatus)\nStato lato servizio: come Windows Autopatch/WUfB sta offrendo gli update ai device.\n> **Nota**: questa tabella potrebbe contenere solo dati relativi a Feature Update se i Quality Update non sono gestiti tramite deployment service."
      },
      "name": "text-section-service"
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "let _deviceFilter = \"{DeviceNameFilter}\";\nlet clientInfo = UCClient\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by AzureADDeviceId\n| project AzureADDeviceId, DeviceName;\nUCServiceUpdateStatus\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by AzureADDeviceId, TargetBuild\n| join kind=leftouter clientInfo on AzureADDeviceId\n| extend DeviceName = iff(isempty(DeviceName), AzureADDeviceId, DeviceName)\n| where _deviceFilter == \"\" or DeviceName contains _deviceFilter\n| summarize DeviceCount = dcount(AzureADDeviceId) by ServiceState, ServiceSubstate, UpdateCategory, UpdateDisplayName, TargetBuild\n| order by UpdateCategory asc, ServiceState asc, DeviceCount desc",
        "size": 0,
        "title": "Service Update Status - Stato dell'offerta lato servizio",
        "timeContext": {
          "durationMs": 0
        },
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
        "visualization": "table",
        "gridSettings": {
          "formatters": [
            {
              "columnMatch": "ServiceState",
              "formatter": 18,
              "formatOptions": {
                "thresholdsOptions": "icons",
                "thresholdsGrid": [
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Offering",
                    "representation": "success",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Pending",
                    "representation": "pending",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "OnHold",
                    "representation": "4",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Canceled",
                    "representation": "cancelled",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "Default",
                    "representation": "unknown",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "filter": true
        }
      },
      "name": "grid-service-status"
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "## ⚠️ Alert (UCUpdateAlert + UCDeviceAlert)\nMostra tutti gli alert (Active e Resolved). Usa il filtro nella tabella per filtrare per stato."
      },
      "name": "text-section-alerts"
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "let _deviceFilter = \"{DeviceNameFilter}\";\nUCUpdateAlert\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| where _deviceFilter == \"\" or DeviceName contains _deviceFilter\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by AlertId\n| project\n    DeviceName,\n    UpdateCategory,\n    AlertType,\n    AlertSubtype,\n    AlertClassification,\n    AlertStatus,\n    Description,\n    Recommendation,\n    ErrorCode,\n    TargetBuild,\n    ClientSubstate,\n    StartTime,\n    ResolvedTime,\n    TimeGenerated\n| order by AlertStatus asc, AlertClassification desc, DeviceName asc",
        "size": 0,
        "title": "Update Alert - Problemi su Update (tutti i tipi)",
        "timeContext": {
          "durationMs": 0
        },
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
        "visualization": "table",
        "gridSettings": {
          "formatters": [
            {
              "columnMatch": "AlertClassification",
              "formatter": 18,
              "formatOptions": {
                "thresholdsOptions": "icons",
                "thresholdsGrid": [
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Error",
                    "representation": "3",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Warning",
                    "representation": "warning",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Informational",
                    "representation": "1",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "Default",
                    "representation": "unknown",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "filter": true
        }
      },
      "name": "grid-update-alerts"
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "let _deviceFilter = \"{DeviceNameFilter}\";\nUCDeviceAlert\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| where _deviceFilter == \"\" or DeviceName contains _deviceFilter\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by AlertId\n| project\n    DeviceName,\n    AlertType,\n    AlertSubtype,\n    AlertClassification,\n    AlertStatus,\n    Description,\n    Recommendation,\n    ErrorCode,\n    StartTime,\n    ResolvedTime,\n    TimeGenerated\n| order by AlertStatus asc, AlertClassification desc, DeviceName asc",
        "size": 0,
        "title": "Device Alert - Problemi generali dei device (Active + Resolved)",
        "timeContext": {
          "durationMs": 0
        },
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
        "visualization": "table",
        "gridSettings": {
          "formatters": [
            {
              "columnMatch": "AlertClassification",
              "formatter": 18,
              "formatOptions": {
                "thresholdsOptions": "icons",
                "thresholdsGrid": [
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Error",
                    "representation": "3",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Warning",
                    "representation": "warning",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Informational",
                    "representation": "1",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "Default",
                    "representation": "unknown",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "columnMatch": "AlertSubtype",
              "formatter": 18,
              "formatOptions": {
                "thresholdsOptions": "icons",
                "thresholdsGrid": [
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "MultipleSecurityUpdatesMissing",
                    "representation": "3",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "EndOfService",
                    "representation": "critical",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "Default",
                    "representation": "warning",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "filter": true
        }
      },
      "name": "grid-device-alerts"
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "## 🖥️ Dettaglio Device - Configurazione WU e stato OS (UCClient)"
      },
      "name": "text-section-device-detail"
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "let _deviceFilter = \"{DeviceNameFilter}\";\nUCClient\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| where _deviceFilter == \"\" or DeviceName contains _deviceFilter\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by AzureADDeviceId\n| project\n    DeviceName,\n    OSVersion,\n    OSBuild,\n    OSEdition,\n    OSQualityUpdateStatus,\n    OSSecurityUpdateStatus,\n    WUQualityDeferralDays,\n    WUQualityPauseState,\n    WUQualityDeadlineDays,\n    WUQualityGracePeriodDays,\n    LastWUScanTime,\n    UpdateConnectivityLevel,\n    DeviceManufacturer,\n    DeviceModel\n| order by DeviceName asc",
        "size": 0,
        "title": "Configurazione Windows Update e Stato OS per Device",
        "timeContext": {
          "durationMs": 0
        },
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
        "visualization": "table",
        "gridSettings": {
          "formatters": [
            {
              "columnMatch": "OSQualityUpdateStatus",
              "formatter": 18,
              "formatOptions": {
                "thresholdsOptions": "icons",
                "thresholdsGrid": [
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Latest",
                    "representation": "success",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "NotLatest",
                    "representation": "warning",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "Default",
                    "representation": "unknown",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "columnMatch": "OSSecurityUpdateStatus",
              "formatter": 18,
              "formatOptions": {
                "thresholdsOptions": "icons",
                "thresholdsGrid": [
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Latest",
                    "representation": "success",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "NotLatest",
                    "representation": "warning",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "MultipleSecurityUpdatesMissing",
                    "representation": "3",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "Default",
                    "representation": "unknown",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "columnMatch": "WUQualityPauseState",
              "formatter": 18,
              "formatOptions": {
                "thresholdsOptions": "icons",
                "thresholdsGrid": [
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "NotConfigured",
                    "representation": "success",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Paused",
                    "representation": "3",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "Default",
                    "representation": "unknown",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "filter": true
        }
      },
      "name": "grid-device-config"
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "---\n### Tabelle utilizzate\n| Tabella | Contenuto |\n|---|---|\n| **UCClientUpdateStatus** | Stato installazione update lato client per device/KB |\n| **UCClient** | Info device: OS, configurazione WU, compliance status |\n| **UCServiceUpdateStatus** | Stato offerta update lato servizio (Autopatch/WUfB) |\n| **UCUpdateAlert** | Alert relativi a problemi su specifici update |\n| **UCDeviceAlert** | Alert relativi a problemi generali del device |"
      },
      "name": "text-footer"
    }
  ],
  "fallbackResourceIds": [],
  "$schema": "https://github.com/Microsoft/Application-Insights-Workbooks/blob/master/schema/workbook.json",
  "styleSettings": {},
  "fromTemplateId": "custom-wufb-quality-updates"
}
